-global-farmland-accounts-for-about-two-thirds-of-agriculture-linked-biodiversity-and-natural-carbon-storage-loss-a-new-study-finds/articleshow/133182304.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/one-third-of-global-farmland-accounts-for-about-two-thirds-of-agriculture-linked-biodiversity-and-natural-carbon-storage-loss-a-new-study-finds/articleshow/133182304.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T18:17:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133183071,imgsize-1048952.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['This is just the beginning': Trump official on 175,000 visa revocations; 'All we ask is a couple of things...']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133182711.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/this-is-just-the-beginning-trump-official-on-175000-visa-revocations-all-we-ask-is-a-couple-of-things-/articleshow/133182711.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/this-is-just-the-beginning-trump-official-on-175000-visa-revocations-all-we-ask-is-a-couple-of-things-/articleshow/133182711.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T17:54:50+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133182755,imgsize-74510.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[New York woman pleads guilty to trafficking Indians from Canada, says she picked people from border and dropped them inside US for profit]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133181087.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timeso