tivity and addressed public safety concerns. Pennsylvania led with 14 removals, followed by Massachusetts with 11 and Vermont with nine.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/the-united-states-removed-100-outdated-dams-in-2025-reconnecting-more-than-4893-river-miles-across-30-states-and-setting-a-single-year-record-for-upstream-habitat/articleshow/133157567.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/the-united-states-removed-100-outdated-dams-in-2025-reconnecting-more-than-4893-river-miles-across-30-states-and-setting-a-single-year-record-for-upstream-habitat/articleshow/133157567.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T15:05:37+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133158019,imgsize-233825.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[77-year-old woman pays $69 to cuddle with strangers, but leaves disappointed]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133177334.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/77-year-old-woman-pays-69-to-cuddle-with-strangers-in-new-york-but-nobody-asks-to-touch-her-and-she-leaves-disappointed/articleshow/133177334.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/77-year-old-woman-pays-69-to-cuddle-with-strangers-in-new-york-but-nobody-asks-to-touch-her-and-she-leaves-disappointed/articleshow/133177334.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T14:58:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133177596,imgsize-819377.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Dry lightning, record-low lake: British Columbia drought puts region on high alert]]>